  "name": "Marshmello",
  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "When he first entered the Top 100 DJs over 11 years ago, Marshmello’s true identity was a secret, and while he’s since been rumbled (he’s the artist formerly known as Dotcom) his iconic mask still allows the focus to be on his music and world-building. This year he’s been working with Illenium again on their classy ‘Close My Eyes’ release, featuring SACHA on vocals. With a current focus on a return to his dance music roots, Marshmello is also relaunching his label Joytime Collective with a promise to sign emerging artists that he’s passionate about, along with independently putting out his own new material.",
